# What NOT to upload as Cloud Build context.
#
# Without this, `gcloud builds submit` uploads the entire working tree — including node_modules
# (hundreds of MB, and reinstalled inside the image by `npm ci` anyway) and, more importantly,
# any local data export sitting in the repo root. Two such files have already appeared during
# this project (a Matrixify .xlsx and _tmp_* files holding live Shopify query output), so the
# data patterns below are deliberate, not boilerplate.
.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/
functions/node_modules/
web/node_modules/
functions/lib/
dist/
web/dist/
coverage/

# Local data exports — never ship customer data into a build context.
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
Export_*
_tmp_*
*.scratch.*

# Emulator / tooling state
.firebase/
*-debug.log

# Not needed by the reasoner image (its Dockerfile copies only shared/, services/, scripts/)
web/
functions/
test/
